k edition and period-start limits.\nOpening cash/equity 20 is synthetic settlement funding; test insufficient cash and\natomic rollback. Exact rational arithmetic is an engineering choice; this does not\nvalidate real currency rounding. Inspection dates do not substitute for effective\nperiods. Matched comparisons hold economics fixed; absent sources stay unresolved.\n\nAudit passes for this bounded plan: no ranking/proxy promotion, source-dependent\nstops are local, and exact outputs answer only the stated conformance question.\n\n## Files and next steps\n\nDeclared new files: scripts/corporate_financing_v1.py,\nscripts/check_accounting_p08.py, tests/test_accounting_p08.py,\ndocs/design/research/p08-v1/*, and the three permitted P08 files. Existing dossier,\nshared engines, frozen corpus and protected supervisor files remain preserved.\nNext: inspect applicable AASB 9, AASB 132 and a legitimate primary comparator;\nrecord source-specific access outcomes; implement engine, generate cases, test\nnegative paths and run unittest plus checker --check. All deliverables unfinished.\nEOF\npython3 -B - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib,hashlib,json\np=pathlib.Path('data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T233421-cea9e631/P08/phase-entry-inventory.json')\nd=json.loads(p.read_text()); print('Inventory entries',len(d))\nfor f in ['AGENTS.md','docs/design/research/standards/aasb132.pdf','docs/design/review/accounting-dossiers/compound-bond.md']:\n print(f,hashlib.sha256(pathlib.Path(f).read_bytes()).hexdigest())\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"Inventory entries 401\nAGENTS.md c0a6c1d6f06760ac148a97fe1be871dd3210e0d55897bc2e8ecf7cfd01554807\ndocs/design/research/standards/aasb132.pdf 5c8ce25447c6186ec49f751bc9e7ad48563caaff542b0e0287f3f7783a480501\ndocs/design/review/accounting-dossiers/compound-bond.md 6833cf448ac1d1ebdf23f5e78be5bbf76210624a160538a7921469075ced1196\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
